INTERPRETATION GUIDE
==============================================================================================================

  - overlay=0% confirms base FCP-15 unaffected.
  - Look for: positive Sharpe AND positive CAGR delta with bounded DD widening.
  - Gross exposure when firing = 100% (base) + overlay% = e.g. 125% or 150%.
  - DD widening should be smaller than CAGR gain for trigger to be worth using.
  - TQQQ pre-2010 is SIMULATED 3x QQQ with 1.5%/y decay drag. Pre-2010 results
    less trustworthy than 2010+.
